  {
    "dataset_kind": "balance_sheet",
    "description": "Instantaneous parallel rate shock and a 30-day deposit run. EVE change from duration/convexity (cash-flow revaluation where duration is missing), net of pay-fixed swap hedges. 12-month NII change from repricing gaps with deposit betas. Credit loss = sum EAD x LGD x stressed PD, stressed PD by Vasicek at q = 0.90 (base) or 0.99 (adverse). Outflows met from cash, then HQLA, then by selling AFS then HTM securities at a fire-sale price p = exp(-impact x share sold), solved as a fixed point. Unrealised losses on HTM count against capital only under mark_to_market; realised losses always do. Pass iff capital ratio >= capital_threshold and LCR >= lcr_threshold after stress. Thresholds are illustrative.",
    "labels": {
      "binding_constraint": [
        "none",
        "capital",
        "liquidity",
        "both"
